  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize the protection of the 'Bagatto' (Trump 1). It is worth 5 points but is easily captured. Use the 'Matto' (Fool) to save a high card from a trick you know your partner will win anyway. If you are the dealer, discard useless low numbers into your 'Scarto' to ensure your team captures those 1-point cards early.\n\nThe 'Public Signal': When your partner leads a suit, if you have the King, tap the table once. This tells them they don't need to waste a Trump. If you have the Ace, you might use the code word 'Batto' to signal that you will take control of the round. Remember, the opponents hear this tooâ€”use it to intimidate them into playing their low trumps early.\n\nTrump Exhaustion: Because there are 21 trumps, you must track which ones have been played. If the 21 and 20 are gone, the 19 becomes the 'King' of the board. Coordination is key: if one partner has high trumps, the other should feed them 'Counters' (10s and face cards) to maximize the point yield from those winning tricks.",
    Player: "Prioritize the protection of the 'Bagatto' (Trump 1). It is worth 5 points but is easily captured. Use the 'Matto' (Fool) to save a high card from a trick you know your partner will win anyway. If you are the dealer, discard useless low numbers into your 'Scarto' to ensure your team captures those 1-point cards early.\n\nThe 'Public Signal': When your partner leads a suit, if you have the King, tap the table once. This tells them they don't need to waste a Trump. If you have the Ace, you might use the code word 'Batto' to signal that you will take control of the round. Remember, the opponents hear this tooâ€”use it to intimidate them into playing their low trumps early.\n\nTrump Exhaustion: Because there are 21 trumps, you must track which ones have been played. If the 21 and 20 are gone, the 19 becomes the 'King' of the board. Coordination is key: if one partner has high trumps, the other should feed them 'Counters' (10s and face cards) to maximize the point yield from those winning tricks.",
